 two tenths of a second over Germany #1."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The two German singles’ silver medallists " [:a {:href "/athletes/156571"} "Susanne Kreher"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/137323"} "Axel Jungk"] " clocked 1:59.53 and saved silver by just 1/100th ahead of Germany #2 with singles’ bronze medallists " [:a {:href "/athletes/137320"} "Jacqueline Pfeifer"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/137322"} "Christopher Grotheer"] ". Only Great Britain #2 with " [:a {:href "/athletes/156523"} "Freya Tarbit"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/148368"} "Marcus Wyatt"] " came within reach of the medals but ended up in an unfortunate fourth place."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button806402", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button806402').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Time"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Run Rank"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Reaction Time"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Reaction Time Rank"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Intermediate Time 1"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Intermediate Rank 1"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Intermediate Time 2"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Intermediate Rank 2"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Intermediate Time 3"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Intermediate Rank 3"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Intermediate Time 4"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Intermediate Rank 4"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Intermediate Time 5"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Intermediate Rank 5"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Split Time 1"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Split Rank 1"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Split Time 2"] [:th {:style "display: none",